# Lesson Types

#### In **Thinking Critically with AI**, Milestone 1 is the project launch, while Milestone 5 is the project shareout.

#### Milestones 2, 3, and 4 follow a consistent two-lesson structure. In each milestone, students first build knowledge about a key AI concept, then apply that learning to create or refine a section of their final project.

* #### The first lesson in each milestone is a **Build Knowledge** lesson.  
* #### The second lesson is a **Develop & Critique** lesson..

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px auto;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/4559dffca35fd2e13ed96b3f1979ed6c-image-1772838094454.01.21 PM.png" 
