## Build Knowledge Lessons
#### **Lessons 3, 5, and 7**

#### During Build Knowledge lessons, students investigate key concepts and skills. They will have the opportunity to choose from one of three explorations related to the milestone's theme. Students gather insights that will directly inform their evolving project work. They will also engage with mini-lessons to deepen their understanding of milestone concepts.

<!-- Voice & Choice -->
<div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;">
