    <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; margin: 5px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.3;">
      Students make meaningful decisions about how they learn, what they explore, and how they demonstrate understanding.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>


## Develop & Critique Lessons 
#### **Lessons 4, 6, and 8**

#### In the Develop & Critique lessons, students synthesize their learning into a tangible artifact that ladders up to the final project. This work unfolds over multiple cycles of feedback and revision. Structured peer discussions, self-assessment tools, and teacher feedback make revision intentional.

<!-- Critique & Revision -->
